                <pb facs="0656" n="562" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg562"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Manion, United States Consular Agent
                        at Johannesburg.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Take instant measures to secure John Hays Hammond protection and fair play.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
